        "text": "None of (A)-(D)"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Add the intervals pairwise",
        "body": "The sum of two open intervals $(p,q)$ and $(r,s)$ is $(p+r,\\ q+s)$:\n\n- $(0,1)+(1,2) = (1,3)$\n- $(0,1)+(3,4) = (3,5)$\n- $(2,3)+(1,2) = (3,5)$\n- $(2,3)+(3,4) = (5,7)$\n\nThe union is $(1,3)\\cup(3,5)\\cup(5,7)$. The numbers 3 and 5 are not obtained: for example $a+b=3$ would need $a<1$ and $b>2$ (then $b>3$, too big) or $a>2$ and $b<1$ (impossible).\n\n**Answer: (D)**"
      }
