    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "Four houses A, B, C, D have a pet each. There are four pets in all, a dog, a cat, a mouse and a rabbit. Of the following statements exactly one is correct:\n\n- The pet in house A is not a rabbit.\n- The pet in house B is not a cat.\n- The pet in house C is not a rabbit.\n- The pet in house D is not a dog.\n- The pet in house A is not a mouse.\n\nWhich pet lives in house A?",
