        "title": "Partitions of 15",
        "body": "A triangle is determined up to congruence by the three arcs between its vertices, measured in steps between neighbouring points: positive integers $a\\le b\\le c$ with $a+b+c=15$ (rotations and reflections only reorder them).\n\nCount by $a$:\n- $a=1$: $b$ from 1 to 7 → 7\n- $a=2$: $b$ from 2 to 6 → 5\n- $a=3$: $b$ from 3 to 6 → 4\n- $a=4$: $b$ from 4 to 5 → 2\n- $a=5$: $b=5$ → 1\n\nTotal $7+5+4+2+1 = 19$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 19**"
      }
